# Frontend layers (byzmo-v2/web)

Layer rules for code under `byzmo-v2/web/src`.  
**Migration process** (waves, orchestration/checklist): see `.cursor/docs/workflow.md` — not this file.

When implementing a feature, also respect the **active** module playbook under `.cursor/docs/<module>/orchestration.md` for what belongs in this slice.

## Dependency direction

- `ui` → `presentation` (+ `dataStore` if needed). Not `data` or `domain` use cases directly.
- `presentation` → `domain` (+ `dataStore`). Not REST clients.
- `domain` → nothing outward (models, repo interfaces, use cases only).
- `data` → implements domain repository interfaces; owns REST/DTOs/mappers.
- `app` → thin Next routes that render `ui` views.
- `ioc` → wires bindings.

## Feature shape

Mirror `Clients` / `Packages`: `domain/<Feature>`, `data/network/rest/v1/<Feature>`, `presentation/<Feature>`, `ui/<Feature>`.

## Contracts

Preserve Byzmo API contracts. UI from `.cursor/docs/ui/references/` when present.
